*   **Schedule 2:** To report your Self-Employment tax.
*   **Schedule B (Interest and Ordinary Dividends):** Required because your interest income ($1,880) is over the $1,500 IRS reporting threshold.
*   **Schedule C (Profit or Loss From Business):** To report your $19,700 in 1099-NEC income and deduct your freelance supplies.
